{
  "_comment": [
    "SYNTHETIC DATA. These schedules are invented for this repository; they are not any",
    "real venue's published calendar. No venue dataset ships from here (DATA-LICENSING.md):",
    "every launch venue forbids commercial redistribution of its calendar, so real",
    "schedules are fetched at run time by the operator under the operator's own",
    "relationship with each venue. This file exists so the CLI and the board can be run and",
    "verified end to end without anyone needing data they may not have.",
    "The three venues exercise three structurally different market models: auctions plus a",
    "mid-day break, a daylight-saving zone whose open is a process, and an always-on venue",
    "with scheduled events that are not phases.",
    "The two bands below are likewise invented for this repository: no desk publishes",
    "'Regional Equities Session' or 'Continuous Markets' as a named grouping. They exist so",
    "the CLI's bands command has something real to derive and overlap; SYNTH-AUCT and",
    "SYNTH-DST never trade at the same UTC hour, so band-regional-equities is trading",
    "whenever either one is, and since SYNTH-ALWAYS never stops, the overlap between the",
    "two bands lands exactly on band-regional-equities' own trading windows — three genuine,",
    "part-of-day overlap stretches, not an empty result and not a full 24-hour block."
  ],
